    "homepage": "https://wordpress.org/themes/unique-gift-shop/",
    "sections": {
        "description": "The Unique Gift Shop Theme is a beautifully crafted WordPress solution for stores that want to present thoughtful, stylish, and creative collections — from personalized keepsakes and handmade treasures to premium luxury finds, eco-friendly presents, gourmet baskets, and curated corporate gifts — while also working wonderfully for related businesses such as flower boutiques, souvenir shops, artisanal craft stores, party supply businesses, lifestyle boutiques, home décor stores, boutique candle brands, handmade jewelry shops, wedding favor sellers, and corporate gifting agencies. Designed to showcase jewelry, tech accessories, wellness hampers, custom mugs, photo frames, engraved items, candles, stationery, greeting cards, and seasonal collections for birthdays, weddings, baby showers, anniversaries, and festive celebrations, it lets you organize products beautifully with clear layouts, responsive design, intuitive navigation, quick-view features, and advanced filters. The theme integrates smoothly with WooCommerce, Contact Form 7, and YITH Wishlist so managing products, orders, customer queries, and wishlists feels effortless. You can easily add gift wrapping, customized packaging, festive promotions, discount coupons, last-minute delivery options, and engaging pop-ups to boost conversions. SEO-ready and optimized for speed, it helps your shop attract customers looking for meaningful and personalized presents, making it ideal whether you run a boutique craft store, an online gift marketplace, or a premium gifting brand."
    },
